      "@type": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap/v0/ns/Process",
      "name": "Swarm dispatch and monitor",
      "summary": "Binds or cold-resumes any multi-agent swarm on a parent Swarm Work Item (epic or milestone in beans, for example a repository Stability epic, a proof-closure epic, or a literature-audit epic) carrying measurable exit criteria (EC-1..EC-k), structured child qu…",
      "description": "Binds or cold-resumes any multi-agent swarm on a parent Swarm Work Item (epic or milestone in beans, for example a repository Stability epic, a proof-closure epic, or a literature-audit epic) carrying measurable exit criteria (EC-1..EC-k), structured child queues (completed, active, queued, idle-backlog), and a live Cold-Start Handover Runbook, then dispatches isolated-worktree workers under a per-swarm spawn gate and supervises them through Process_SwarmMonitorSweep until the epic drains or halts.",
      "enforcement": "strict",
      "sourcePath": "sdlc/processes/swarm-dispatch-and-monitor.bpmn",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/litlfred/cat-harness/blob/main/sdlc/processes/swarm-dispatch-and-monitor.bpmn",
